SUMMARY:Cullman Veterans Hall of Fame Dinner and Ceremony
LOCATION:Loft 212\, 212 4th St SW\, Cullman
DESCRIPTION:The Cullman Veterans Hall of Fame inducts its fourth class with
  a dinner and ceremony at Loft 212\, honoring county veterans from World W
 ar II\, Vietnam and the Global War on Terror. Doors open at 5:30 PM and th
 e program starts at 6:15 PM. Each inductee receives a plaque that will han
 g in the courthouse. Time: Doors 5:30 PM\, ceremony 6:15 PM Host: Cullman 
 Veterans Hall of Fame (VFW Post 2214\, DAV Chapter 101\, American Legion P
 ost 4) Cost: Dinner event\; to attend\, contact VFW Post 2214\, DAV Chapte
 r 101 or American Legion Post 4
